   "id": 506887,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Calculate <span data-math=\"\\frac{{4.6 \\times {{10}^{ - 4}}}}{{8 \\times {{10}^{ - 8}}}}\">\\frac{{4.6 \\times {{10}^{ - 4}}}}{{8 \\times {{10}^{ - 8}}}}</span>.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"5.75 \\times {10^3}\">5.75 \\times {10^3}</span>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{{4.6 \\times {{10}^{ - 4}}}}{{8 \\times {{10}^{ - 8}}}}\"></span></p>\n<p>Step 1: Divide the number parts.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"4.6 \\div 8 = 0.575\"></span></p>\n<p>Step 2: Subtract the exponents of the 10s.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"-4 - (-8) = 4\"></span></p>\n<p>Step 3: The result is the answer from Step 1 times 10 raised to the answer from Step 2.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"0.575 \\times {10^4}\"></span></p>\n<p>Step 4: If the answer is not in scientific notation, adjust it.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"5.75 \\times {10^3}\"></span></p>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
